  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Landing Page**\n\nI\'m now focused on translating the \"wleewarrenmd.com\" layout analysis into a Spanish landing page design, per request. The key specifications are the next step for consideration.\n\n\n**Defining the App\'s Structure**\n\nI\'m solidifying the application\'s structure now. I\'ve decided on a one-page scroll layout including a hero section, book promotion, podcast section, newsletter signup, and footer. The color scheme is locked in: black, light gray/cream, and a dark gray footer. I\'m focusing on text contrast with white on black and black on cream. I\'ll utilize a serif font for titles and a sans-serif for body text, with ample spacing.\n\n\n**Constructing the Application**\n\nI\'m now building the application structure with React components, organizing sections into `Navbar.tsx`, `Hero.tsx`, `BookPromo.tsx`, `Podcast.tsx`, `Newsletter.tsx`, and `Footer.tsx`. These will be integrated into `App.tsx`, after which I\'ll handle linting and compilation. Also, I\'m fetching fonts and setting up the Tailwind configuration in `index.css`. The fonts will be \'Playfair Display\' for serif and \'Inter\' for sans-serif text. I\'m focusing on defining theme variables for colors and fonts.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
