n\'t exist natively in lucide-react, using external link visual or omitting */}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center text-xs font-sans text-gray-500\">\n            <span>&copy; {currentYear} Dr. Lee Warren. Todos los derechos reservados.</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">Privacidad</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">T\303\251rminos</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n"
    }
